{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_43","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat >> ../PROGRESS.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Implementation checkpoint\n- Development directory: Buzz-Comb-Party-Buzz-Bombers-1983-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261106-045748.\n- Vendored engine v0.89.1 at 8ecc2f6 and pristine Hub session client 1.4.0 at 35a1047. Native engine unmodified. Official harness fixtures present.\n- Implemented fixed-tick simulation, stable reward claims, two-hit swept pulses, workers/fast bees, geometric hive pockets, bird flight/feed/call/irritation, interval flowers/relocation, stock/last-pulse priority, six data-authored encounters and harvest-opened four shield buds.\n- First ordinary-input simulation pilot wins all six at 621.49 seconds, score 188600, with normal ammo/cooldowns, 340 shots, 154 hits, 74 feeds, 7 banked hives, 3 swaps, 1 escape. See evidence/pilot-first.json.\n- Added native procedural rigs/animation, garden rendering/HUD, code audio, native menus/settings/dev tools, input adapters, local co-op, attract director, authoritative Hub adapter and reproducible single-HTML builder.\n- Initial headless native game and file:// Chromium boots are error-free. Title -> play -> pause works. Two early captures in evidence need visual review.\n- Still to do: comprehensive one-command suite, real official Hub harness scenarios and two-copy actions, controller/touch/browser/audio checks, targeted fixes, About/report metadata, docs/designer examples and final artifact verification. Screens currently use release report placeholder until exit-interview.json is written.\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
