d local Canvas transforms; all custom translated creatures were invisible.','fix':'Track transformed actor drawing bounds in Renderer. Reset pixel color cache after rig restore.','verified':False});json.dump(issues,open(p,'w'),indent=2)\nPY\nnpm run build && /home/micha/.local/share/pipx/venvs/playwright/bin/python tests/browser-first.py\"","aggregated_output":"npm notice run buzz-comb-party@1.0.0 build\nnpm notice run node tools/build.mjs\nBuzz-Comb-Party-Buzz-Bombers-1983-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261106-045748.html (1377047 bytes)\nboot {'game': True, 'scene': 'title', 'errors': []}\nplay {'scene': 'play', 'status': 'intro', 'errors': []}\npause {'paused': True, 'screen': 'pause', 'errors': []}\nerrors []\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_46","type":"agent_message","text":"Visual review caught an engine issue that the boot tests missed: translated custom rigs were being cropped away. I fixed the actor bounds tracking, and the next capture shows the cans, bird, bees, and combs correctly. The change is documented alongside the pinned engine revision.\n"}}
