{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_54","type":"agent_message","text":"Solo and local co-op full-run tests pass. The official Hub harness also passes normal, impaired-network, host-departure, server-hosted, and one-player scenarios. The additional two-copy gameplay test found a missed remote bird call and a departure-handling problem; I’m fixing those before treating multiplayer as complete.\n"}}
