ard controller starts the game without a mouse\", \"pass\": true, \"detail\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"stick movement plus Cross sprays\", \"pass\": true, \"detail\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"R2 also sprays\", \"pass\": true, \"detail\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"Square calls Pip through shared ability\", \"pass\": true, \"detail\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"Options pauses all standalone simulation timers\", \"pass\": true, \"detail\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"live tuning changes real simulation and clamps fill\", \"pass\": true, \"detail\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"tuning reset restores widgets and simulation\", \"pass\": true, \"detail\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"developer single tick works while overlay is frozen\", \"pass\": true, \"detail\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"invalid JSON profile keeps known-good tuning\", \"pass\": true, \"detail\": \"\"}, {\"name\": \"browser automation completed\", \"pass\": false, \"detail\": \"Traceback (most recent call last):\\n  File \\\"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/gpt-6.1-sol-max.build-v2__20261106-045748__x3131e9/work/Buzz-Comb-Party-Buzz-Bombers-1983-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261106-045748/tests/browser.py\\\", line 60, in <module>\\n    page.get_by_role('button',name='Settings',exact=True).click()\\n    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^\\n  File \\\"/home/micha/.local/share/pipx/venvs/playwright/lib/python3.14/site-packages/playwright/sync_api/_generated.py\\\", line 18032, in click\\n    self._sync(\\n    ~~~~~~~~~~^\\n        self._impl_obj.click(\\n        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\\n    ...<11 lines>...\\n        )\\n        ^\\n    )\\n    ^\\n  File \\\"/home/micha/.local/share/pipx/venvs/playwright/lib/python3.14/site-packages/playwright/_impl/_sync_base.py\\\", line 115, in _sync\\n    return task.result()\\n           ~~~~~~~~~~~^^\\n  File \\\"/home/micha/.local/share/pipx/venvs/playwright/lib/python3.14/site-packages/playwright/_impl/_locator.py\\\", line 165, in click\\n    return await self._frame._click(self._selector, strict=True, **